# NeMo Gym — code ownership
#
# Two kinds of lines in this file:
#
#   <path-pattern> @user-or-team ...
#     Standard CODEOWNERS syntax. ENFORCED: GitHub auto-requests review from
#     these owners, and main's branch protection requires their approval
#     before merge.
#
#   # suggest: <path-pattern> @user-or-team ...
#     Same path-pattern syntax, prefixed with a literal `# suggest:` comment
#     tag. GitHub ignores these comments; suggest-reviewers.yml requests
#     the listed reviewers. check-review-approvals.sh enforces their policy
#     on GitHub and GitLab, with native rules taking precedence. Teams with
#     exactly Ananth and Yuya are optional during rollout.
#
# Put a `# suggest:` line right under the enforced rule it relates to, so
# there's one file to update instead of two.
#
# The LAST matching pattern applies independently to native rules and suggestions.

